  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 12:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSeven Approved Lots | 1,002m² Freehold | Prime Coastal Location & Rangitoto Zone\r\n\r\nSeize this outstanding development opportunity: 1,002m² of freehold land with Resource Consent, Building Consent and Engineering Plan Approval granted for a seven-lot development, with Council and Watercare approvals in place.\r\n\r\nZoned Residential – Mixed Housing Urban, this coastal site comes with approved plans for three substantial freestanding homes and four terrace houses, offering a range of layouts for future buyers.\r\n\r\nAPPROVED DEVELOPMENT — 7 LOTS\r\n\r\nLOT 1 — FREESTANDING HOUSE | 195.67m² | 5 BEDROOMS | 3.5 BATHROOMS | SINGLE GARAGE\r\n\r\nLOT 2 — FREESTANDING HOUSE | 210.46m² | 6 BEDROOMS | 4.5 BATHROOMS | SINGLE GARAGE\r\n\r\nLOT 3 — FREESTANDING HOUSE | 210.11m² | 6 BEDROOMS | 4.5 BATHROOMS | SINGLE GARAGE\r\n\r\nLOTS 4–7 — TERRACE HOUSES | 121.54m² EACH | 3 BEDROOMS | 2.5 BATHROOMS | SINGLE GARAGE\r\n\r\nCOASTAL LOCATION WITH SOUGHT-AFTER SCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy stroll to Rothesay Bay Beach, Browns Bay Beach, local shops, cafés and Browns Bay Primary School. Zoned for Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Intermediate, the location combines coastal lifestyle appeal with excellent everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nEXISTING LEGAL HOME & INCOME\r\n\r\nThe existing concrete block and vertical weatherboard home offers a three-bedroom main residence plus a legal one-bedroom income, providing flexibility while you prepare your development program. The main home also includes a study nook, attic office and a lower-level workshop or hobby room.\r\n\r\nDevelop now or landbank for the future—the generous site, approved seven-lot scheme and desirable coastal setting make this an opportunity worth acting on.",
